 "notes": "120 episodes (3 cells x 40, seed 4750), 0 LLM generation calls, about 2 minutes of Isaac. The first launch ran the driver under the wrong Python environment and failed before any episode; relaunched under the Isaac environment with nothing changed. Authority is adequate by the declared rule (ff 0.69, rf 0.82 of the full 20 mm; every eligible case positive; no speed bound, cap or action clamp active, joint-limit bound on 0.11 of ff steps in the + cell only). Roll progress pro minus anti over steps 150-209: -0.054 rad [-0.147, +0.038], 32 eligible cases; the upper bound is below the predicted +0.10. Pen-surface displacement under the fingertips was 1.4 mm (ff) and 0.5 mm (rf) against 14 mm of fingertip travel. Post hoc explanation, not predeclared: the forefinger, ring and little fingertips are never within 15 mm of the pen surface under this incumbent (median about 58 mm away from step 100 on); only the middle fingertip and thumb are at the surface (within 15 mm on 0.92 and 0.89 of steps). The two fingers that tracked in D-069 were moving in free space. Contact impulses unavailable (no contact sensor); contact is inferred from link-origin distance to an ideal capsule."
